menu "FiReplace Control Configuration"

    config FIREPLACE_TEMP_HYSTERESIS
        int "Temperature hysteresis, unit: degrees F"
        range 0 20
        default 2
        help
            After the set temperature is reached the fireplace stays off until the
            temperature drops this many degrees below the set temperature.

    config FIREPLACE_SENSOR_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
        int "Sensor timeout, unit: seconds"
        range 1 86400
        default 300
        help
            If no sensor reading arrives within this time, or none has arrived since
            boot, the fireplace is forced off. The sensor reports every 60 seconds.

    config FIREPLACE_MAX_ON_SECONDS
        int "Maximum on time, unit: seconds"
        range 60 604800
        default 21600
        help
            The fireplace is forced off this long after the remote turned it on.
            It stays off until the remote turns it off and on again.

endmenu
